{
  "name": "Formulas",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The number of mutagens you can concoct when you finish a rest, and the number of formulas you know, increases as you gain levels in the blood hunter class, as shown on the Mutagencraft table above. Additionally, when you learn a new mutagen formula, you can replace one formula you already know with a new mutagen formula. You choose four mutagen formulas to learn from the Optional Features page, and you can concoct one mutagen when you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
